                                                "sense_id": "602f6282-fb40-36f8-99ed-d2340332c389",
                                                "text": "\"How much sleep will you get tonight?\" I asked.\n\"Three to five hours,\" she replied, making me feel a bit more like I was talking to someone from my own planet and not a bionic superwoman designed by a genetic engineer."
                                            }
